% kono
%
% The Logical English (for LPS) twin of an Epilog game, written by the Epilog translator
% from kono.hrf (kept in sources/): the operations are causal laws, the
% views over the state intensional fluents.
% The scenario is a play EpilogJS made; LPS2's final state of it is checked against EpilogJS's
% (test_epilog.pl).
% Source: the Epilog Games page, http://epilog.stanford.edu/homepage/game.php?game=kono
%
% DISCLAIMER. This program was written by a translator from a program of another
% system. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
% implied, including any warranty that it is accurate, complete or fit for a
% particular purpose. The translation may be wrong: check it against its source
% before relying on it. It is not legal, tax, insurance, financial or other
% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move jump with *a thing*, *a second thing*, *a third thing*, *a fourth thing*, *a fifth thing* and *a sixth thing* is made; known as jump.
    the move kerchunk is made; known as kerchunk.
    the move move with *a thing*, *a second thing*, *a third thing* and *a fourth thing* is made; known as move.

the fluents are:
    *an index* cell *a second index* with *a mark*; known as cell.
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    *a role* is the score of *a thing*; known as score.
    *a thing* is a step; known as step.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the move jump with *a thing*, *a second thing*, *a third thing*, *a fourth thing*, *a fifth thing* and *a sixth thing* is legal; known as legal_jump.
    the move move with *a thing*, *a second thing*, *a third thing* and *a fourth thing* is legal; known as legal_move.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *a thing* doublet *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.
    *a thing* triplet *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing* with *a fifth thing* with *a sixth thing*.
    *a thing* horizontal *an index* with *a second thing* with *a second index*.
    *an index* vertical *a thing* with *a second index* with *a second thing*.
    *an index* is an index.
    the nextspot of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    the incr of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    the succ of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    *a thing* slash *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.
    *a thing* backslash *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.

the knowledge base kono includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/kono.hrf".

a thing doublet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing horizontal the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing.

a thing doublet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the third thing horizontal the fourth thing with the thing with the second thing.

a thing doublet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing vertical the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing.

a thing doublet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the third thing vertical the fourth thing with the thing with the second thing.

a thing doublet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing slash the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing.

a thing doublet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the third thing slash the fourth thing with the thing with the second thing.

a thing doublet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing backslash the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing.

a thing doublet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the third thing backslash the fourth thing with the thing with the second thing.

a thing triplet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing with a fifth thing with a sixth thing if
    the thing horizontal the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and the third thing horizontal the fourth thing with the fifth thing with the sixth thing.

a thing triplet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing with a fifth thing with a sixth thing if
    the fifth thing horizontal the sixth thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and the third thing horizontal the fourth thing with the thing with the second thing.

a thing triplet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing with a fifth thing with a sixth thing if
    the thing vertical the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and the third thing vertical the fourth thing with the fifth thing with the sixth thing.

a thing triplet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing with a fifth thing with a sixth thing if
    the fifth thing vertical the sixth thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and the third thing vertical the fourth thing with the thing with the second thing.

a thing triplet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing with a fifth thing with a sixth thing if
    the thing slash the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and the third thing slash the fourth thing with the fifth thing with the sixth thing.

a thing triplet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing with a fifth thing with a sixth thing if
    the fifth thing slash the sixth thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and the third thing slash the fourth thing with the thing with the second thing.

a thing triplet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing with a fifth thing with a sixth thing if
    the thing backslash the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and the third thing backslash the fourth thing with the fifth thing with the sixth thing.

a thing triplet a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing with a fifth thing with a sixth thing if
    the fifth thing backslash the sixth thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and the third thing backslash the fourth thing with the thing with the second thing.

a thing horizontal an index with a second thing with the index if
    the nextspot of the thing is the second thing
    and the index is an index.

an index vertical a thing with the index with a second thing if
    the nextspot of the thing is the second thing
    and the index is an index.

1 is an index.

2 is an index.

3 is an index.

4 is an index.

the nextspot of 1 is 2.

the nextspot of 2 is 3.

the nextspot of 3 is 4.

the incr of 0 is 12.

the incr of 12 is 25.

the incr of 25 is 37.

the incr of 37 is 50.

the incr of 50 is 62.

the incr of 62 is 75.

the incr of 75 is 87.

the incr of 87 is 100.

the succ of 1 is 2.

the succ of 2 is 3.

the succ of 3 is 4.

the succ of 4 is 5.

the succ of 5 is 6.

the succ of 6 is 7.

the succ of 7 is 8.

the succ of 8 is 9.

the succ of 9 is 10.

the succ of 10 is 11.

the succ of 11 is 12.

the succ of 12 is 13.

the succ of 13 is 14.

the succ of 14 is 15.

the succ of 15 is 16.

the succ of 16 is 17.

the succ of 17 is 18.

the succ of 18 is 19.

the succ of 19 is 20.

the succ of 20 is 21.

the succ of 21 is 22.

the succ of 22 is 23.

the succ of 23 is 24.

the succ of 24 is 25.

the succ of 25 is 26.

the succ of 26 is 27.

the succ of 27 is 28.

the succ of 28 is 29.

