the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is legal at a time if
    a role is a control at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with the role at the time
    and the thing doublet the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and the third thing cell the fourth thing with blank at the time.

the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is legal at a time if
    red is a control at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with red at the time
    and the thing triplet the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing with the fifth thing with the sixth thing
    and the third thing cell the fourth thing with red at the time
    and the fifth thing cell the sixth thing with black at the time.

the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is legal at a time if
    black is a control at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with black at the time
    and the thing triplet the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing with the fifth thing with the sixth thing
    and the third thing cell the fourth thing with black at the time
    and the fifth thing cell the sixth thing with red at the time.

the goal of a role is a number at a time if
    the role is the score of the number at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    a role is the score of 100 at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    30 is a step at the time.

when the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and the thing cell the second thing with a mark
then the thing cell the second thing with blank
    and it is not the case that the thing cell the second thing with the mark.

when the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and the thing cell the second thing with a mark
    and the fifth thing cell the sixth thing with a second mark
then the fifth thing cell the sixth thing with the mark
    and it is not the case that the fifth thing cell the sixth thing with the second mark.

when the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and the thing cell the second thing with a mark
    and the mark is the score of a seventh thing
    and the incr of the seventh thing is a eighth thing
then the mark is the score of the eighth thing
    and it is not the case that the mark is the score of the seventh thing.

when the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and black is a control
then red is a control
    and it is not the case that black is a control.

when the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and red is a control
then black is a control
    and it is not the case that red is a control.

when the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and a seventh thing is a step
    and the succ of the seventh thing is a eighth thing
then the eighth thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the seventh thing is a step.

when the move kerchunk is made
    and black is a control
then red is a control
    and it is not the case that black is a control.

when the move kerchunk is made
    and red is a control
then black is a control
    and it is not the case that red is a control.

when the move kerchunk is made
    and a thing is a step
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the thing is a step.

when the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and the thing cell the second thing with a mark
then the thing cell the second thing with blank
    and the third thing cell the fourth thing with the mark
    and it is not the case that the thing cell the second thing with the mark
    and it is not the case that the third thing cell the fourth thing with blank.

when the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and black is a control
then red is a control
    and it is not the case that black is a control.

when the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and red is a control
then black is a control
    and it is not the case that red is a control.

when the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and a fifth thing is a step
    and the succ of the fifth thing is a sixth thing
then the sixth thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the fifth thing is a step.

it must not be true that
    the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move jump with the thing, the second thing, the third thing, the fourth thing, the fifth thing and the sixth thing is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move move with the thing, the second thing, the third thing and the fourth thing is legal.

initially 1 cell 1 with black
    and 1 cell 2 with black
    and 1 cell 3 with black
    and 1 cell 4 with black
    and 2 cell 1 with black
    and 2 cell 2 with black
    and 2 cell 3 with black
    and 2 cell 4 with black
    and 3 cell 1 with red
    and 3 cell 2 with red
    and 3 cell 3 with red
    and 3 cell 4 with red
    and 4 cell 1 with red
    and 4 cell 2 with red
    and 4 cell 3 with red
    and 4 cell 4 with red
    and red is the score of 0
    and black is the score of 0
    and 1 is a step
    and red is a control.

